# 32. AI-Specific Defect Categories

AI-related issues can be classified separately.

### AID-001 – Incorrect information

Gemini provides factually incorrect content.

### AID-002 – Irrelevant response

Response does not address the student's question.

### AID-003 – Wrong difficulty

Beginner request produces an overly technical answer.

### AID-004 – Context loss

Follow-up question is interpreted incorrectly.

### AID-005 – Poor quiz quality

Generated question does not match the selected topic.

### AID-006 – Unsupported certainty

The model presents uncertain information too confidently.

These defects should be documented and used to improve prompts, validation, or application logic.

